      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RIGBY REIGN (5) bolted in last time, scoring by 4.5 lengths in slick time (19.97) to take a Grade 5 in a new PB this course and distance. Smart win latest and looks a key chance again. BENNY TRICK (2) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 20.08 beating MISTY BONUS. Boasts a strong record from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Expecting another bold showing. BRINDLE BONUS (1) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by a nose at this track in a handy 20.28. Can make it back-to-back wins. SLOWLY SURE (8) scored last time and can measure up again.",
